 465:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c **** /*
 466:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * Save away a copy of the Q-table referenced by each component present
 467:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * in the current scan, unless already saved during a prior scan.
 468:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  *
 469:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * In a multiple-scan JPEG file, the encoder could assign different components
 470:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * the same Q-table slot number, but change table definitions between scans
 471:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * so that each component uses a different Q-table.  (The IJG encoder is not
 472:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * currently capable of doing this, but other encoders might.)  Since we want
 473:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * to be able to dequantize all the components at the end of the file, this
 474:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * means that we have to save away the table actually used for each component.
 475:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * We do this by copying the table at the start of the first scan containing
 476:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * the component.
 477:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * The JPEG spec prohibits the encoder from changing the contents of a Q-table
 478:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * slot between scans of a component using that slot.  If the encoder does so
 479:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * anyway, this decoder will simply use the Q-table values that were current
 480:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * at the start of the first scan for the component.
 481:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  *
 482:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * The decompressor output side looks only at the saved quant tables,
 483:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  * not at the current Q-table slots.
 484:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c ****  */
 485:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c **** 
 486:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdinput.c **** LOCAL(void)
